!! answers ~ listed

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`listed` params=`exit/0 fields/[[standoffs standoffCount pending pendingCount face]] ~ every row, each naming its island; a standoff names its key and a pending removal the commit that took its file, where one did`>>
```

